sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant CLI as CLI
    participant RAG as RAGPipeline
    participant V as Vector Search
    participant B as BM25
    participant H as Hybrid RRF
    participant R as Reranker
    participant LLM as LLM Provider
    participant C as Citation Builder

    User->>CLI: Ask question
    CLI->>RAG: answer_question(query, video_ids)
    RAG->>V: Retrieve semantic candidates
    RAG->>B: Retrieve lexical candidates
    V-->>H: Ranked vector hits
    B-->>H: Ranked BM25 hits
    H-->>R: Deduplicated candidates, RRF ranks
    R-->>RAG: Final top-K chunks
    RAG->>LLM: Question + transcript context
    LLM-->>RAG: Answer text
    RAG->>C: Build timestamp citations
    C-->>RAG: YouTube-linked sources
    RAG-->>CLI: Answer and sources
    CLI-->>User: Render cited answer
